OVERVIEW:

This document describes the project files used to produce two versions of the file essential.pdf
The project is version controled using git. The backup git repository is at /Volumes/Store/calcbook.

PROJECT MANIFEST:

README -- This file.

## Contains the TeX files for the project; cover art; postscript figure; and utility scripts.
calculus/
   
   This calculus book is written in TeX (not LaTeX).
   The file calculus/HOW_TO_BUILD_PROJECT.md describes how to work with and build the document.
   
   The book cover is jpg/frontcover.jpg.
   
   
## Copyright file. Describes what has been done for copyright protection.
   COPYRIGHT.txt
   

## TeX FILES:
   blank.tex          # Used to create a blank page.
   diffApprox.tex     # The derivative as approximation (mean value and Taylor's theorem).
   diffcalc.tex       # Differential Calculus
   diffcalceq.tex     # Differential Equations
   differencecalc.tex # Difference Calculus
   differenceeq.tex   # Difference Equations
   functions.tex      # Function Appendix
   howtostudy.tex     # Appendix F: How to Study from This Book (retention/study strategies).
   induction.tex      # Induction Appendix
   intcalc.tex        # Integral Calculus
   limitdef.tex       # Limit Appendix
   linfunc.tex        # Linear Function Appendix
   main.tex           # MAIN TEX FILE
   preface.tex        # Preface text.
   references.tex     # References section: works cited and kindred educational works.
   sumcalc.tex        # Summation Calculus
   taylor.tex         # Appendix on Taylor's theorem and the generalized mean value theorem
   title.tex          # Title with cover used in main.tex (uses eps/cover.eps)

   ## Standalone companion document (not \input by main.tex; produces pdf/math_education_ideas.pdf)
   math_education_ideas.tex # Notes on the calcbook's educational philosophy.
   
## Utility scripts/auxillary files
   make            # Used to preview a draft
      
   py/
   process_index.py

   ## This directory houses the postscript files from Mathematica which constitute the figures in the book. 
   ## It also contains the file cover.eps which is part of the title page used by the draft generator main.tex.
   eps/
   
   ## Contains the JPG for the front cover art.
   jpg/
   
   
## Contains TeX macros and TeX parameter files
util/


## Mathematica notebook which has the figures used in the book.
calculus.nb   


## Finished Papers
pdf/




